{"id":"102b16872a6480ee","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-semantic-locality.md","title":"一阶求值的自由变量局部性","display":"lem-semantic-locality — 一阶求值的自由变量局部性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-semantic-locality","aliases":["72-lem-semantic-locality"],"display":"lem-semantic-locality — 一阶求值的自由变量局部性","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.1.2, print27–28/PDF39–40; local structural induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-semantic-locality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-semantic-locality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-semantic-locality — 一阶求值的自由变量局部性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.1.2, print27–28/PDF39–40; local structural induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a> 的非空结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span>、项求值及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,r\\in D^V\">\\(s,r\\in D^V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns\\restriction\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=r\\restriction\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,r},\\\\\ns\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=r\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,r}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns\\restriction\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=r\\restriction\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,r},\\\\\ns\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=r\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,r}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对项归纳：变量只读其坐标，常元不读赋值，函数应用逐分量使用归纳假设。再对公式归纳；原子由项结论，布尔构造由对应真值函数。量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"QxB\">\\(QxB\\)</span> 分支中，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>，两个更新赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto d]\">\\(s[x\\mapsto d]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[x\\mapsto d]\">\\(r[x\\mapsto d]\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\)</span> 上一致，故各量化实例真值相同。此证明同时处理真、假常元及零元关系，不假定赋值仅定义在自由变量上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]] 的非空结构 $\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$、项求值及 $\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}$；$s,r\\in D^V$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$A\\in X_\\Sigma$；$\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)$ 与 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)$ 取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}","display":false},{"tex":"s,r\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ns\\restriction\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=r\\restriction\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,r},\\\\\ns\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=r\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,r}(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"QxB","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"s[x\\mapsto d]","display":false},{"tex":"r[x\\mapsto d]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)","display":false}],"bytes":1956,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-locality|lem-semantic-locality — 一阶求值的自由变量局部性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]"},{"id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：无量词片段按子公式的语法成员关系检测，显式区分对象量词节点与元语言量化。求值的自由变量局部性与代入性质已在 [[72-lem-semantic-locality]]、[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]] 给出独立证明；这些为后续性质导航。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-locality|lem-semantic-locality — 一阶求值的自由变量局部性]]"},{"id":"b286b5d2520ff936","anch